se stroke and 0.0001 kg of use wear.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Whether load 0.10 produces penetration or displacement, and whether it damages the point, remain untested.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Establish a reusable method for moving small amounts of surface soil without excessive tool damage.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Inspected branch and nearby forest soil.\\\",\\\"Completed shaping.\\\",\\\"Tested one stroke at load 0.05; recorded no displacement.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Shaped branch item-45-ivo-520.\\\",\\\"Verified negative result for forest-floor use at load 0.05.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"A successful soil-moving stroke and evidence of its wear and damage.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Try one stroke at load 0.10 on the same patch, then assess the result.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The first trial distinguishes successful shaping from actual digging effectiveness; no digging benefit has yet been observed.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","logprobs":[]}

